1
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:53,880
Hello, Ling'er.

2
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:55,920
Are you free this afternoon?

3
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:58,960
Come to Xuehua Cold Drink Shop if you have time.

4
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:00,760
I need your help with something.

5
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,560
I'll wait for you.

6
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,120
Xuefei.

7
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:11,580
It's not that I don't want to help you.

8
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:14,400
My relationship with my mom has always been bad.

9
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:16,330
And with what happened to Shengli,

10
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:19,940
we haven't contacted each other for over ten years.

11
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:22,520
I still don't know how to face her.

12
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:23,560
What should I do then?

13
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:24,680
I'm out of ideas.

14
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:27,170
You're the only one who can help me.

15
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:29,080
No, you came here in such a hurry.

16
00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:30,480
What exactly happened?

17
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:34,060
I always feel that my mom is still in Xinchun.

18
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:35,560
After so many years,

19
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:37,280
I finally found a clue.

20
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,080
Aunt Li and my mom

21
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:41,440
used to work in the same unit.

22
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:42,970
They were both log scalers.

23
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:43,880
I think

24
00:01:44,039 --> 00:01:45,600
Aunt Li might know something

25
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:48,000
about the people and things from back then.

26
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:50,320
Just give me her phone number.

27
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:52,780
You don't need to worry about anything else.

28
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,759
Then I'll look for it for you.

29
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:57,220
But let's make it clear first.

30
00:01:57,440 --> 00:01:58,560
If you contact her,

31
00:01:58,640 --> 00:01:59,800
don't mention a word about me.

32
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:00,480
I know.

33
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:03,300
I definitely won't. Why would I mention you?

34
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:07,640
I don't know if she still uses this number.

35
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:09,500
You can try contacting her first.

36
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:11,880
If you can't reach her, I'll find

37
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:12,920
another way for you.

38
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:13,520
Okay.

39
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:17,880
That's great.

40
00:02:19,079 --> 00:02:20,040
What are you doing tonight?

41
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:21,240
Ask Lao Lin to join us.

42
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,880
I'll treat you two to dinner.

43
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:25,200
What dinner?

44
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:26,960
Lao Lin is hospitalized.

45
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,480
I have to go to the hospital to accompany him.

46
00:02:28,480 --> 00:02:29,640
Why is he hospitalized?

47
00:02:29,640 --> 00:02:30,900
What's wrong with him?

48
00:02:34,079 --> 00:02:34,920
Lung cancer.

49
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,040
Late stage.

50
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:41,079
He had been coughing before.

51
00:02:41,079 --> 00:02:42,610
I felt something was wrong.

52
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:46,160
He wouldn't show me his medical report either.

53
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:48,000
When he was looking for the wood,

54
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:48,960
he fainted.

55
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,280
Dajun just told me

56
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:52,040
that he sent him to the hospital.

57
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:55,040
The doctor said the cancer cells have already spread.

58
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:59,440
Even in the hospital, he was still talking to me about the wood.

59
00:02:59,440 --> 00:03:00,570
I thought to myself,

60
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:02,680
he's already like this,

61
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,680
what's the use of having this money?

62
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:08,640
Then what are you going to do?

63
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,730
I don't know.

64
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:20,640
Here it is.

65
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:25,120
They said the delivery will be in the provincial capital next Friday.

66
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:27,040
Should we ask about the exact location?

67
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:27,640
Don't ask.

68
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:30,090
They are very cautious.

69
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,520
Let's not alert them.

70
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:32,880
By the way,

71
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:35,420
from Xinchun to the provincial capital,

72
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:38,640
how long does it take at the fastest via the back roads?

73
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:41,700
Three days.

74
00:03:42,079 --> 00:03:43,210
At least three days.

75
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:46,010
Brother,

76
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:47,760
do you think this person

77
00:03:47,760 --> 00:03:49,360
could be the one we've met?

78
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:51,170
I'm not sure.

79
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,160
But,

80
00:03:54,079 --> 00:03:55,680
we only have three days left.

81
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:56,690
We need to hurry.

82
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:58,040
Okay.

83
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,100
Whether he's a deer

84
00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:02,760
or a paper tiger,

85
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:06,250
we'll make him show his true colors in three days.

86
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:12,960
Hello.

87
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,120
Who is this?

88
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:17,920
Hello, Aunt Li.

89
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:18,959
This is Xuefei,

90
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,279
Li Xuefei,

91
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:22,010
Wu Mingyue's daughter.

92
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,080
Xuefei.

93
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,760
What can I do for you?

94
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:31,540
I know it might be presumptuous to bother you like this,

95
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:34,040
but you know my mom has

96
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,360
been missing for so many years.

97
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,820
I'm really out of options.

98
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:41,360
Could you tell me if you saw her

99
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:43,240
around New Year's Eve back then?

100
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:43,960
Or...

101
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:44,640
Child,

102
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,320
I really can't help you.

103
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:46,720
I...

104
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,159
I didn't see her,

105
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:49,820
and I don't know anything.

106
00:04:50,159 --> 00:04:50,560
Okay.

107
00:04:50,640 --> 00:04:52,480
Then how about this?

108
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:54,480
When you have some free time,

109
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:55,760
let's meet up.

110
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:58,280
You can tell me anything about her,

111
00:04:58,280 --> 00:04:59,360
anything at all.

112
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:00,120
Just in case...

113
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:00,760
Child,

114
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,440
it's been so many years,

115
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:04,800
and you've safely grown into a young woman.

116
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:06,330
If your mom were still here,

117
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,520
she would definitely be very happy.

118
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,200
About what happened back then,

119
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:12,080
I really don't know anything.

120
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:15,520
Saying more will only make you sad,

121
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:17,080
so let it go.

122
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,720
Maybe your bond as mother and daughter

123
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,520
was only meant to last that long.

124
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:22,480
Child,

125
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:24,240
let it go.

126
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,960
Live your life well.

127
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:27,240
No.

128
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:29,920
I can't let it go.

129
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:31,680
Aunt Li,

130
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:33,440
I'm really out of options.

131
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:34,640
I'm begging you.

132
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:38,600
I dream of my mom every night.

133
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,680
Sometimes she smiles at me,

134
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:43,360
and sometimes she's locked in a dark room.

135
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:45,040
I really have no other way.

136
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:47,320
Please just help me, okay?

137
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:12,160
But shouldn't the size of this

138
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:14,200
be made a little smaller?

139
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,440
Mr. Teng.

140
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:17,080
Can I help you?

141
00:06:17,440 --> 00:06:18,300
Director Chen.

142
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:21,960
I have something to discuss with Mr. Wang.

143
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:23,490
Just a few words in private.

144
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:40,640
Mr. Wang.

145
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:43,690
I'm sorry to come over so abruptly,

146
00:06:44,159 --> 00:06:45,490
but I have a favor to ask.

147
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:51,680
See

148
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:53,920
if you can

149
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,600
be magnanimous,

150
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:56,520
show mercy,

151
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:59,520
and let Xiaohu off this time.

152
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,640
I didn't make things difficult for Mr. Teng.

153
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:02,880
It's Mr. Teng

154
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:04,480
who, since I came to Xinchun,

155
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:06,740
has been making things difficult for me.

156
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:08,480
All these injuries on my body

157
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,840
are thanks to him.

158
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,960
If anyone should be begging,

159
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:14,740
it should be me begging Mr. Teng to let me off.

160
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,680
Now only you can help him.

161
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,200
Boss Teng,

162
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:25,240
I don't have that much power.

163
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:29,560
The police are looking for Xiaohu everywhere.

164
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,420
I was thinking,

165
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:33,320
if you could

166
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:36,200
issue a letter of forgiveness, Mr. Wang.

167
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:37,280
I'll find Xiaohu,

168
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:40,040
and we can go to the police station together

169
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,100
to clear things up.

170
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:44,280
I'll give you whatever you want.

171
00:07:44,280 --> 00:07:45,080
Mr. Teng,

172
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:48,159
you and your son are so alike.

173
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:50,040
Don't you understand by now?

174
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,920
Teng Xiaohu broke the law.

175
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,520
He shot someone.

176
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,560
He wanted me dead.

177
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:57,080
It was attempted murder.

178
00:07:57,880 --> 00:08:00,040
This isn't about forgiveness at all.

179
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:02,240
No.

180
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,480
He's my only son.

181
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:08,400
You know,

182
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:10,480
as parents,

183
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:13,160
we don't ask for much,

184
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,600
just that our children are safe.

185
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:18,000
Xiaohu's mother passed away early,

186
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,730
and I was busy with the factory,

187
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:22,240
so I wasn't a good father.

188
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:23,920
Xiaohu

189
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:27,000
always blamed me for not saving his mother.

190
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:29,660
But speaking of which,

191
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,280
here in Xinchun,

192
00:08:33,559 --> 00:08:35,159
there used to be another boss

193
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:36,559
named Zhao.

194
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,360
His family

195
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,679
was very loving.

196
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:43,240
Everyone here

197
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:44,159
envied them.

198
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,300
Come to think of it,

199
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:48,520
his son

200
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:51,700
should be about Xiaohu's age.

201
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:53,160
Please go back, Mr. Teng.

202
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:55,320
I really can't help you with this.

203
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:56,120
Zhao Long.

204
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:00,480
I knew your parents.

205
00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:04,360
When your family had trouble back then,

206
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,600
I couldn't help.

207
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:08,090
You have resentment in your heart,

208
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:10,340
and I can understand that.

209
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:14,540
But these things have nothing to do with Xiaohu.

210
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,520
Let Xiaohu go.

211
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:18,960
Tell me what you want.

212
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,520
Do you want my factory

213
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,360
or the pine wood?

214
00:09:24,280 --> 00:09:25,400
I'll give it all to you.

215
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:26,040
Okay.

216
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,680
Since we're talking about this,

217
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,120
let me ask you.

218
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:33,840
That batch of painted old Korean pine.

219
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:35,100
Why is it in your hands?

220
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,440
Who gave it to you?

221
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:40,280
What old Korean pine?

222
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:41,720
I don't have it.

223
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:42,560
Mr. Teng.

224
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,520
There's no need to talk anymore.

225
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:46,320
Wait a minute.

226
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,120
Since you brought it up,

227
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,360
you better make yourself clear.

228
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:51,800
What painted old Korean pine?

229
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:54,080
I don't know anything about painted old Korean pine.

230
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:54,840
I came to you

231
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:56,440
to beg you to let Xiaohu go.

232
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:58,560
And you're talking to me about this?

233
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:02,330
How would I know anything about painted old Korean pine?

234
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:04,520
Are you trying to wipe us out?

235
00:10:04,520 --> 00:10:05,760
Wipe you out?

236
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:07,440
Who is wiping who out?

237
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:09,380
You are the ones wiping us out.

238
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:11,240
For the sake of wood,

239
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,680
you would do anything.

240
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,240
Your son wasn't blown to pieces

241
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:17,040
like my parents were.

242
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:20,930
Teng Laohu, let me tell you.

243
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:23,140
For what happened in the past,

244
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:26,200
none of you will get away.

245
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:55,520
Xuefei.

246
00:10:55,880 --> 00:10:57,480
Ever since I got your call,

247
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,080
I've been feeling

248
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:00,440
uneasy.

249
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:03,560
What happened to your mother is your nightmare,

250
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:05,040
but it's mine too.

251
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:07,160
Overnight,

252
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:09,040
your mother disappeared.

253
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:11,680
Something also happened to Wang Min's family.

254
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:14,400
That child named Zhao Long went missing.

255
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:16,600
They were my youth,

256
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:19,080
and witnessed so much of my life.

257
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,280
To be honest,

258
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:23,640
I don't believe your mother would run off with someone either.

259
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:25,080
But I'm useless.

260
00:11:25,520 --> 00:11:26,980
I couldn't be of much help.

261
00:11:27,280 --> 00:11:28,560
Over the years,

262
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:30,880
I've often dreamed of them too.

263
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,320
These photos,

264
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:35,320
I hope they can be of some help to you.

265
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:49,320
Hello.

266
00:12:49,880 --> 00:12:50,640
Zhao Long.

267
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:54,660
Who is this?

268
00:12:55,040 --> 00:12:56,700
The thing you're looking for,

269
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,400
I know where it is.

270
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:00,320
What thing?

271
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:01,760
Korean pine.

272
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:04,120
Old painted Korean pine.

273
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,890
The paint applied back then

274
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:09,240
was red, yellow, and blue.

275
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:11,680
It's been sixteen years.

276
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:15,170
The colors must have seeped into the core of the wood.

277
00:13:16,040 --> 00:13:17,170
Three days from now,

278
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:18,960
at 10:00 p.m.,

279
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:21,960
at the old railway crossing in the west of the city.

280
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,220
You don't have to come.

281
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:24,800
But those pieces of wood,

282
00:13:24,800 --> 00:13:26,440
and the story behind them,

283
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:28,280
you'll never figure out.

284
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:29,520
Who exactly are you?

285
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:39,800
Zhao Long.

286
00:13:41,640 --> 00:13:43,000
Zhao Long.

287
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:45,200
Zhao Long.

288
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:04,960
Wang Hong.

289
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,330
Are you feeling better?

290
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:12,440
I don't know if it was a fever or a nightmare.

291
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:14,240
You tossed and turned all night.

292
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:21,600
I'm fine.

293
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:23,360
Thank you.

294
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:27,120
Your eyes...

295
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:52,090
You are Aunt Wang Min's son,

296
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:53,880
Zhao Long,

297
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,280
right?
